  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Inscribe a glyph that triggers as you decide. Explosive Rune: each creature within 20 ft of the glyph makes a DEX save, taking 5d8 damage of the type you chose (Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning or Thunder), half on a success (+1d8 per slot level above 3rd). Spell Glyph stores a spell of 3rd level or lower to cast when it triggers.</p>",
